  "schema_version": 1,
  "kind": "help-article",
  "title": "Customizing the Zscaler Client Connector User Agent",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://help.zscaler.com/zscaler-client-connector/customizing-zscaler-client-connector-user-agent",
    "node": "1328961",
    "revision": "3248894",
    "updated": "2026-10-23",
    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "You can customize the User Agent with a suffix that the IdP reads as specific strings it expects during authentication to identify the user agent. You can create a user agent suffix globally or for each domain."
    },
    {
      "text": "To create either a global or domain-based suffix for a user agent:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Infrastructure > Client Connector > User Agent.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          46
        ],
        [
          49,
          65
        ],
        [
          68,
          78
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the User Agent page under WBC User Agent, select one of the following:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          17
        ],
        [
          29,
          43
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Global",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To enable the Global suffix:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Global User Agent Suffix field, enter the suffix you want Zscaler Client Connector to append to user agents.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          31
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Domain-Based",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To create a user agent suffix for each domain:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Under Manage User Agent Suffix, click Add.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          30
        ],
        [
          38,
          41
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Add Custom User Agent Suffix drawer, complete the following fields:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          35
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Select Domain drop-down menu, select a domain provisioned for your organization.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Enter Suffix field, enter the suffix you want Zscaler Client Connector to append to user agents associated with this domain.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To delete a suffix:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Delete icon (🗑) next to the suffix.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          16
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Confirm Delete window, click Delete.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          21
        ],
        [
          36,
          42
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
